<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>04 / 套路层面</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>套路掌握与知识点掌握必须分别评价</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={240} viewBox='0 0 1140 240'><rect x='0' y='0' width='555' height='240' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><rect x='585' y='0' width='555' height='240' rx='8' fill='#EAF3FD'/><text x='277.5' y='34' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>套路掌握</text><text x='862.5' y='34' font-size='20' fill='#1E7BE0' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>知识点掌握</text><circle cx='28' cy='68' r='4' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='44' y='74' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>能按固定路径求某类函数导数</text><circle cx='28' cy='102' r='4' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='44' y='108' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>回答：会不会做这一类题</text><circle cx='28' cy='136' r='4' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='44' y='142' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>证据：套路题的独立完成情况</text><circle cx='28' cy='170' r='4' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='44' y='176' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>不能换算成全部关联知识点满分</text><circle cx='613' cy='68' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='74' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>理解导数定义、几何意义与不同条件下的应用</text><circle cx='613' cy='102' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='108' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>回答：是否理解概念与适用条件</text><circle cx='613' cy='136' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='142' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>证据：概念辨析、变式、延迟保持</text><circle cx='613' cy='170' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='176' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>不能因整题错误判全部知识点未掌握</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #0E2340', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>“知识点是步骤的学习前置、步骤组成套路”是教学关系；“学生通过一道套路题”是一次可观察表现——前置关系不能替代实际取证</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：套路层面设计思路.md §2</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 38 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>